    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660120/extras/2011a1beb1b2bf95420e48a6af74421b.avif?t=1713164086\" width=231 height=87 /></span><br><br>The main character who gambled with people.<br>He was the main character who went all-in with a good hand, but he lost.<br>The main character who lost all his money got dizzy at the moment<br>At that moment, the people around me start to look like paintings.<br><br>Can they survive the attacks of people who have turned into pictures?<br><br><br>It's a side-scrolling action game. It's pixelated, but it has some characters that are attractive with picturesque graphics.<br>It only supports single play, and lives with the gambling addict protagonist and meets the end of the story in person.",
